OL,3,ADemocrat Scott Colom makes history as
OL,4,AMississippi's first black senator since
OL,5,A19th Century
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe result means the Democrats will
OL,8,Fhold 55 seats in the 100-member Senate,
OL,9,Fwith a knife-edge race in Alaska still
OL,10,Fto be called.
